id=quest_mitm_ca
name=Quest MITM Test CA
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=victor
description=Trusts the sandboxed OpenWrt test CA for graph.facebook-hardware.com (CN=graph.facebook-hardware.com), so a rooted Quest 1 will complete TLS to a local dummy server standing in for that host. Built with build.sh from magisk-system-ca; see examples/quest_mitm_ca/README.md for provenance.
